<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56091" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατόρθ-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>setting straight</i>, of a fractured bone, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				26
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Art.</u>
				71
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>setting up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ θρόνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ps.</u>
					96(97).2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>successful accomplishment</i> of a thing, <i>success</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1380b4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				9.19.4
			</span></i>: in pl., <i>successes</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				39.7.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>setting right, reform, amendment</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς πολιτείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.30.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν πραγμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.53.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> as philos.
			term, <i>right action</i>, = foreg. <i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				3.21
			</span></i> (pl.), al.</div>
